    "geometry_bounds": "centers [-2,2]^2, angles unbounded, 0<h<=1.5 without positive floor",
    "coefficient_fit": "column-scaled damped Newton; no ridge or rank truncation; energy Armijo test, then residual-norm Armijo test after 8 energy halvings; accepted at relative stationarity 1e-13 or, in recovery mode, 4 times the residual rounding floor; otherwise the run stops with status inner_solve_failure",
